data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `privacy-masking` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/privacy-masking/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/privacy-masking/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/privacy-masking /mnt/user-data/workspace/privacy-masking\npython /mnt/skills/custom/ffmpeg-utils/scripts/run.py --operation keyframe --input-path /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --timestamp 1 --output-path /mnt/user-data/workspace/privacy-masking/source.jpg --output /mnt/user-data/workspace/privacy-masking/keyframe_result.json\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nregions = {\"sensitive_regions\":[{\"type\":\"face\",\"bbox\":[20,20,180,160]}]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/privacy-masking/regions.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(regions, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/privacy-masking/scripts/run.py --image-uri /mnt/user-data/workspace/privacy-masking/source.jpg --sensitive-regions-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/privacy-masking/regions.json --method gaussian_blur --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/privacy-masking/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/privacy-masking/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"70cd4d09-1f00-48ce-b0f2-fd5cdb119570"},{"content":"我将严格按照要求测试 `privacy-masking` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n**步骤 1：读取 SKILL.md 文件**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":133,"prompt_tokens":9188,"total_tokens":9321,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":38,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":133},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,